    {
      "name": "dsh-agent-roster",
      "title": {
        "en": "Agent roster",
        "zh": "角色花名册"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A profile-wide roster of role templates with one-click team building: a \"+\"-menu flow that injects the chosen template's instruction into the current conversation so the lead agent creates the member through the roster_spawn tool (template prompt frozen, template model applied). Includes roster_template_save / roster_template_list agent tools and an Agent roster manager in Settings. Members are ordinary subagents.",
        "zh": "一份全 profile 共用的角色模板库，把组建团队变成一键操作：“+”菜单把所选模板的指令注入当前会话，由 lead agent 通过 roster_spawn 工具创建成员（模板指令冻结、模板模型生效）。附带 roster_template_save / roster_template_list 工具，以及设置页的角色花名册管理。成员就是普通子代理。"
      },
      "icon": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
