    {
      "name": "dsh-engram",
      "title": {
        "en": "engram memory",
        "zh": "engram 记忆"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Durable agent memory backed by a local engram daemon: six curated memory tools (search, save, context, timeline, stats, projects), DSH↔engram session bridging, optional prompt injection, and cloud-sync status. Daemon stewardship is host-side; secrets stay in the credential store.",
        "zh": "由本地 engram 守护进程支撑的 agent 持久记忆：六个精选记忆工具（搜索、保存、上下文、时间线、统计、项目列表）、DSH↔engram 会话桥接、可选的提示注入与云同步状态。守护进程托管在宿主侧；密钥只存于凭据存储。"
      },
